    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d254">

                <pb facs="0415" n="291" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg291"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.428/666</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Harding to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-08-15"><hi rendition="#italic">August 15,
                        1921</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: I have to acknowledge
                    yours of August 15th<anchor n="4" xml:id="d254-f1"/> in which you enclose to me
                    copies of correspondence relating to the treaty between the United States and
                    Great Britain for the Protection, Preservation and Propagation of the Salmon
                    Fisheries in the Waters Contiguous to the United States and Canada and the
                    Fraser River System, and agreeable to the recommendations which you make I am
                    sending to the Senate the request for the return of the Convention to me.</p>
                <p>Sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Warren G. Harding</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
